  "description": "GPAL (Generally Positive Automation Library) is a fluent C# library for automating browsers, desktop applications, AI services, and data, then chaining them into a single workflow. Drives Chrome, Edge, and Firefox across 9 different automation engines, including a built-in Puppeteer engine that needs no external driver at all and reaches the browser over a debugging port or a pipe. Add the optional GPALRestAPI and OttoMagic browser extension for REST-driven browser automation and smart element detection.",
